# Direct dependencies. Edit this file, then regenerate the lock:
#
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --output-file requirements.lock requirements.in
#
# See producer/requirements.in for why torch comes from a separate index and why
# the lock is hashed. The same reasoning applies here.
#
# Note what is absent: the Kubernetes client. The consumer receives its key
# through a mounted volume and never talks to the API server, so it needs no
# ServiceAccount token and no RBAC at all.

--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu

